# Autonomous review loop and agent ops runtime state
# Ignore all runtime contents, but track README.md schema docs in metadata dirs.
# Git requires un-ignoring parent dirs before un-ignoring children.
.claude/runtime/*
!.claude/runtime/README.md
!.claude/runtime/worktree_registry/
.claude/runtime/worktree_registry/*
!.claude/runtime/worktree_registry/README.md
!.claude/runtime/session_metadata/
.claude/runtime/session_metadata/*
!.claude/runtime/session_metadata/README.md
!.claude/runtime/task_state/
.claude/runtime/task_state/*
!.claude/runtime/task_state/README.md

